ter is a relaxed camper that likes to be as comfortable as possible. He likes to spend a lot of time in the forest during the day or next to a campfire at night. Please draw them however you would like to.\n\nhttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/Ey_N1xbXEAUVoxE?format=jpg&name=4096x4096", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yadoku_gaeru/works/33", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c4fa39a8/uploads/origins/c63229bb-4609-4b34-bfb1-b79e7dce116e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b70334120ab7b32c93845dea303cd2b4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c4fa39a8/uploads/origins/c63229bb-4609-4b34-bfb1-b79e7dce116e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b70334120ab7b32c93845dea303cd2b4, https://si.imgix.net/c4fa39a8/uploads/origins/c63229bb-4609-4b34-bfb1-b79e7dce116e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=80f878575cbb8c9de8b42598c048e64d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c4fa39a8/uploads/origins/c63229bb-4609-4b34-bfb1-b79e7dce116e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=68a533690319643ca818651a48f570bb 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yadoku_gaeru/works/32", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bea1b7ad/uploads/origins/eeccb494-d7dd-4b86-a57a-923cff21ebac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=063adf5b14036fa7b9413209c65bd02f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bea1b7ad/uploads/origins/eeccb494-d7dd-4b86-a57a-923cff21ebac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=063adf5b14036fa7b9413209c65bd02f, https://si.imgix.net/bea1b7ad/uploads/origins/eeccb494-d7dd-4b86-a57a-923cff21ebac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ffdbcd0dcff5c82bb72740d432e59dbf 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bea1b7ad/uploads/origins/eeccb494-d7dd-4b86-a57a-923cff21ebac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a7a2306231bbdfb4e8b0b387ab3639a3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "他の依頼もありがとうございました。スーパーヒーローのマスクと髪型をした女の子たちが、水着を着ているものをお願いできますか？金髪の仮面アメリカは、アメリカの水着を着なければなりません。ヘッドバンドをしている金髪の子は別の子で、髪の色は変わりません。水着はあなたが選んでください。ありがとうございました!\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/sh/o6dv7fmozp4nqr8/AAAMteZCJAk7909NlewfCUfaa?dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yadoku_gaeru/works/31", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f78c9d75/uploads/origins/033dd9f6-8612-4423-b80e-bc7212f08f20?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e666c51c35b16251a4adbebb53b56505", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f78c9d75/uploads/origins/033dd9f6-8612-4423-b80e-bc7212f08f20?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e666c51c35b16251a4adbebb53b56505, https://si.imgix.net/f78c9d75/uploads/origins/033dd9f6-8612-4423-b80e-bc7212f08f20?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10d828609ca8165191a4a3e09f115cac 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f78c9d75/uploads/origins/033dd9f6-8612-4423-b80e-bc7212f08f20?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=734b8d40188ac9edab4e8cfd92254a8e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, nice to meet you!\n\n科学者の男の子と、パートナーのVoir博士を描いてください。不器用な手でクリップボードを落としそうになっている少年に、Voir博士が後ろからぶつかってきました。\n\n背景は科学実験器具と科学、そして元素「レントゲニウム-282」の原子図です。\n\nhttp://refsheet.net/nanosheep/drvoir\n\nhttp://refsheet.net/nanosheep/nanosheep", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yadoku_gaeru/works/30", "